      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my stomach has been acting up lately, like a constant gnawing feeling and really bad heartburn for the last few days. anyway, i have a massive headache right now, what's the best thing i can take for it? i have some ibuprofen in the cabinet, is that okay?",
