      "content": "Even for a regular headache, it's important to follow dosing instructions carefully. For adults, standard over-the-counter ibuprofen doses are often 200mg to 400mg every 4 to 6 hours, but this depends on the specific strength of the tablets you have. Always check the packaging directions or consult a healthcare provider to ensure the dosage is appropriate for you and doesn't conflict with your stomach issues.",
